    5. Build input — palette row, frame_color frame, black interior.
    6. Place winner_count (2-10) pixels of winner_color at random interior positions such that their bounding box equals the chosen bbox (ensure pixels at bbox corners/extremes).
    7. Place loser_count (1 to winner_count-1) pixels of loser_color at random interior positions (no overlap with winner pixels).
